# This directory is also the whole of ZzyzxLabs/SUPer-Chart (a mirror of it),
# and its build output is committed to frontend/sup-wallet/vendor. Both must
# be byte-identical on every platform, so it is LF everywhere: a Windows
# checkout with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise write CRLF, and the build
# embeds source text in its source maps.
* text=auto eol=lf
